Third-party and vendor material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Vendor kernel modules.

   No MediaTek kernel modules are distributed with this project.  The GPU DVFS
   modules analysed during development (`mtk_gpufreq_mt6789.ko`,
   `mtk_gpufreq_wrapper.ko`, `mtk_gpu_power_throttling.ko`) are proprietary works
   of MediaTek Inc. and/or the device vendor.  They remain the property of their
   respective owners and are NOT covered by this project's license.  Users must
   obtain them, and any rights to use them, from the device or its vendor.

   The `.gitignore` excludes `*.ko` files so that local copies are never
   committed.  Any patched module produced by this tooling is derived from the
   vendor binary and is likewise not distributed here.

2. Synthetic test fixtures.

   The test suite builds its own minimal ELF64 objects.  It does not require any
   vendor binary and contains no extracted vendor data.

3. Python standard library only.

   The installable package (`src/mtk_gpufreq_re/`) has no third-party runtime
   dependencies.  Optional development extras (`ruff`, `build`) are separate
   works under their own licenses and are not redistributed here.

